{"strongs": "H7969", "word": "שָׁלשׁ", "translit": "sha.losh", "root": "שלש", "morph": "H:N", "pos": "noun masculine and feminine", "gloss": "a three, triad", "definition": "שָׁלשׁ , שָׁלוֺשׁ , שְׁלשָׁה 430 noun masculine and feminine a three, triad (Late Hebrew id. ; שלש SI 2 ; שלשן 30 MI 2 ; Phoenician שלש ; Assyrian šalaštu, šalatu ; Sabean שלתֿ Hom Chr 47, 124 , but also תֿלתֿ , etc., Id. 47, A. u. A. ii. 175 SabDenkm No. 31, 8 ; Arabic , ; Ethiopic Aramaic תְּלָתָא , ; Nabataean תלת Lzb 377 ; Palmyrene תלת (in תלת מאה ) Reckend ZMg xiii (1888), 408 ; see also Kö ii. 1. 208 ); — masculine שָׁלשׁ וֺשׁ - rare, chiefly late), with noun feminine Amos 4:8 + 90 t., also construct שְׁלשׁ Gen 18:6 + 65 t. (but Gen 38:24 read perhaps שְׁלשֶׁת Samaritan, compare Di and others), שְׁלָשֿׁ Exod 21:11 feminine שְׁלשָׁה ( וֺשָׁה - rare, chiefly late), with noun masculine Gen 6:10 + 149 t., also construct שְׁלשֶׁת Amos 4:4 + 92 t. (3 + 10 = 13 are additional; on rare exceptions to rule of gender compare Ges «GKC:97c»§ 97c ), suffix שְׁלָשְׁתְּכֶם Num 12:4 , שְׁלָשְׁתָּם v Num 12:4 ; Ezek 40:10 ; Ezek 41:16 — three (Hexateuch chiefly P ): 1. no other number: \\ \\ a. before plural noun, שָׁלשׁ 51 t., e.g. אַמוֺת ׳ שׁ Exod 27:1 +, בָּאַמָּה ׳ שׁ 1Kgs 7:27 , שְׁלשָׁה 90 t., e.g. Gen 18:2 + (so always שְׁלשׁ , שְׁלשֶׁת ; read מִשְׁלשֶׁת Gen 38:24 Sam Di ; = ׳ מִשְּׁ , from מִןֿ ); after noun (late: on 1Sam 1:24 see [ שִׁלֵּשׁ ) 1Chr 25:5 + 17 t.; noun omitted 1Sam 17:4 ; 2Sam 24:12 = 42 t. \\ \\ b. = ordinal יָמִים ׳ לִשׁ Exod 19:5 on third day ; ׳ הַיּוֺם שׁ הַיָּמִים 1Sam 9:20 , ׳ הַיּוֺם הַשּׁ 1Sam 30:13 , both = three days ago ; especially לְ ׳ בִּשְׁנַת שׁ 1Kgs 15:28 + 7 t. ( Ges «GKC:134o»§ 134o ). 2. 13, with noun feminine : שְׁלשׁ עֶשְׂרֵהשָׁנַה Gen 17:25 ; 1Kgs 7:1 + (as ordinal) Gen 14:4 ( שְׁלשֿׁ ), Jer 1:2 ; Jer 25:3 before ערים Josh 21:19 after, Josh 19:16 + 3 t., before עִיר Josh 21:33 ; 1Chr 6:43 , אַמּוֺת Ezek 40:11 with noun masculine שְׁלשָׁה עָשָׂר before פָּרִים Num 29:14 after, v Num 29:13 ordinal before יוֺם Esth 3:12 ; Esth 9:1 after, v Esth 9:17 יוֺם omitted Esth 3:13 ; Esth 8:12 ; Esth 9:18 גוֺרָל omitted 1Chr 24:13 ; 1Chr 25:20 ; 1Chr 26:11 . 3. 300 = שְׁלשׁ מֵאוֺת Gen 5:22 + 59 t. ( 1Chr 11:11 perhaps intentional change [H PS Sm ] from שְׁמֹנֶה || 2Sam 23:8 which certainly original, Vrss Th We Dr and modern); 3000 = שְׁלשֶׁת אֲלָפִים Exod 32:28 +28 t. 4. c. tens, ׳ שׁ following Num 1:43 + 11 t., precedes Lev 12:4 +17 t., + (as ordinal) 3 + 20 Jer 52:30 +3 t.; 20 + 32 Ki Jer 12:7 + 2 t. 5. as round, or conventional, number: 2 ( or ) 3, Amos 4:8 ; Deut 17:6 ; Josh 7:3 ; 2Kgs 9:32 ; Isa 17:6 3 ( and ) 4, Prov 30:15 ; Prov 30:18 ; Prov 30:21 ; Prov 30:29 three days' journey Exod 3:18 ; Exod 5:3 ; Exod 8:23 , etc.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8762')\">BDB8762</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7969')\">H7969</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8761')\">BDB8761</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8763')\">BDB8763</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שָׁלשׁ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>שָׁלוֺשׁ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>שְׁלשָׁה</bdbheb><sub>430</sub> <b>noun masculine and feminine</b> <highlightword>a three, triad</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight>; <bdbheb>שלש</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('SI')\"><reflink>SI</reflink><sup>2</sup></lookup>; <bdbheb>שלשן</bdbheb> 30 <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MI')\"><reflink>MI</reflink><sup>2</sup></lookup>; Phoenician <bdbheb>שלש</bdbheb>; Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>šalaštu, šalatu</highlight></transliteration>; Sabean <bdbheb>שלתֿ</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hom')\">Hom<sup>Chr 47, 124</sup></lookup>, but also <bdbheb>תֿלתֿ</bdbheb>, etc., Id.<sup>47, A. u. A. ii. 175</sup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('SabDenkm')\">SabDenkm<sup>No. 31, 8</sup></lookup>; Arabic <placeholder5584/>, <placeholder5585/>; Ethiopic <placeholder5586/> <placeholder5587/> Aramaic <bdbarc>תְּלָתָא</bdbarc>, <placeholder5588/>; Nabataean <