; <ref ref=\"Ezek 40:10\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(26,40,10)\">Ezek 40:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 41:16\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(26,41,16)\">Ezek 41:16</ref> — <highlight>three</highlight> (Hexateuch chiefly <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>): </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> no other number: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> before plural noun, <bdbheb>שָׁלשׁ</bdbheb> 51 t., e.g. <bdbheb>אַמוֺת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 27:1\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(2,27,1)\">Exod 27:1</ref> +, <bdbheb>בָּאַמָּה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:27\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,27)\">1Kgs 7:27</ref>, <bdbheb>שְׁלשָׁה</bdbheb> 90 t., e.g. <ref ref=\"Gen 18:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,18,2)\">Gen 18:2</ref> + (so always <bdbheb>שְׁלשׁ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>שְׁלשֶׁת</bdbheb>; read <bdbheb>מִשְׁלשֶׁת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 38:24\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(1,38,24)\">Gen 38:24</ref> Sam <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup>; = <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִשְּׁ</bdbheb>, from <bdbheb>מִןֿ</bdbheb>); after noun (late: on <ref ref=\"1Sam 1:24\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(9,1,24)\">1Sam 1:24</ref> see [<bdbheb>שִׁלֵּשׁ</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"1Chr 25:5\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(13,25,5)\">1Chr 25:5</ref> + 17 t.; noun omitted <ref ref=\"1Sam 17:4\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(9,17,4)\">1Sam 17:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 24:12\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(10,24,12)\">2Sam 24:12</ref> = 42 t. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> = ordinal <bdbheb>יָמִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לִשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 19:5\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(2,19,5)\">Exod 19:5</ref> <highlight>on third day</highlight>; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַיּוֺם שׁ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>הַיָּמִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 9:20\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(9,9,20)\">1Sam 9:20</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַיּוֺם הַשּׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 30:13\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(9,30,13)\">1Sam 30:13</ref>, both = <highlight>three days ago</highlight>; especially <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בִּשְׁנַת שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 15:28\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(11,15,28)\">1Kgs 15:28</ref> + 7 t. (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:134o»§ 134o</sup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> 13, with <b>noun feminine</b>: <bdbheb>שְׁלשׁ עֶשְׂרֵהשָׁנַה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 17:25\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(1,17,25)\">Gen 17:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:1\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,1)\">1Kgs 7:1</ref> + (as ordinal) <ref ref=\"Gen 14:4\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(1,14,4)\">Gen 14:4</ref> ( <bdbheb>שְׁלשֿׁ</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Jer 1:2\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(24,1,2)\">Jer 1:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 25:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,25,3)\">Jer 25:3</ref> before <bdbheb>ערים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 21:19\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(6,21,19)\">Josh 21:19</ref> after, <ref ref=\"Josh 19:16\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(6,19,16)\">Josh 19:16</ref> + 3 t., before <bdbheb>