v><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> 300 = <bdbheb>שְׁלשׁ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>מֵאוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 5:22\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(1,5,22)\">Gen 5:22</ref> + 59 t. (<ref ref=\"1Chr 11:11\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(13,11,11)\">1Chr 11:11</ref> perhaps intentional change [H<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('PS')\">PS<sup>Sm</sup></lookup>] from <bdbheb>שְׁמֹנֶה</bdbheb> || <ref ref=\"2Sam 23:8\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(10,23,8)\">2Sam 23:8</ref> which certainly original, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Vrss')\"><reflink>Vrss</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('The')\">Th</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup> and modern); 3000 = <bdbheb>שְׁלשֶׁת אֲלָפִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 32:28\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(2,32,28)\">Exod 32:28</ref> +28 t. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> c. tens, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> following <ref ref=\"Num 1:43\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"43\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"43\" onclick=\"bcv(4,1,43)\">Num 1:43</ref> + 11 t., precedes <ref ref=\"Lev 12:4\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(3,12,4)\">Lev 12:4</ref> +17 t., + (as ordinal) 3 + 20 <ref ref=\"Jer 52:30\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(24,52,30)\">Jer 52:30</ref> +3 t.; 20 + 32 Ki <ref ref=\"Jer 12:7\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(24,12,7)\">Jer 12:7</ref> + 2 t. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> as round, or conventional, number: 2 (<highlight>or</highlight>) 3, <ref ref=\"Amos 4:8\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(30,4,8)\">Amos 4:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 17:6\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(5,17,6)\">Deut 17:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 7:3\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(6,7,3)\">Josh 7:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 9:32\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(12,9,32)\">2Kgs 9:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 17:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,17,6)\">Isa 17:6</ref> 3 (<highlight>and</highlight>) 4, <ref ref=\"Prov 30:15\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(20,30,15)\">Prov 30:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 30:18\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(20,30,18)\">Prov 30:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 30:21\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(20,30,21)\">Prov 30:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 30:29\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(20,30,29)\">Prov 30:29</ref> <highlight>three days' journey</highlight> <ref ref=\"Exod 3:18\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(2,3,18)\">Exod 3:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 5:3\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(2,5,3)\">Exod 5:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 8:23\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(2,8,23)\">Exod 8:23</ref>, etc. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Amos 4:8", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 4, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Gen 18:6", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 18, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Gen 38:24", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 38, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "Exod 21:11", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 21, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Gen 6:10", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 6, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Amos 4:4", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 4, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Num 12:4", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 12, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Ezek 40:10", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 40, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Ezek 41:16", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 41, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Exod 27:1", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 27, "verse": 1}, {"ra